CancelOrder_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when caller is not the offer maker
│  └── it should revert with NotOfferMaker
└── when caller is the offer maker
   ├── given root not ratified
   │  └── it should revert with RootNotRatified
   ├── given market de listed
   │  └── it should still unratify the root
   └── given market allowlisted
      ├── it should unratify the root
      ├── it should return the root
      └── it should emit OrderCancelled
